      "weather": "Fine",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BATTLE SPEED (7) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and three placings from seven starts. Hit the frame latest (20.07) when third at Goulburn in a Grade 5. Looks suited and should go close. CLYBURN (5) is a talented dog who has been too quick to win his last two on end, the latest leading throughout at Goulburn (19.86). Has a good record at this journey. Recorded the quickest time on the card last start. Expecting another bold showing. INTREPID EAGLE (1) is a sprinter who excels over the short dashes. Found it a bit far latest when finished fifth over 630m at Nowra (37.12) in a Grade 4/5 but is better suited back in trip here. Goes very well at the journey winning one races. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Deserves plenty of respect. MOO MOO'S MAGIC (2) generally performs well over this distance.",
